(218, 7, 'Level 20', 'LOOPS AND BRANCHING', 'The Vault Search', 'At the vault, two nested loops walk through every row and every column of the grid. When the value is found, the program sets foundNum to true and uses a labeled break to terminate the outer loop at once, instead of only the inner one. The guide labels the outer loop searchLabel.

Assume numbers, searchNum and foundNum already exist. Label the outer for loop searchLabel:, loop with i < numbers.length and j < numbers[i].length, and when searchNum == numbers[i][j], set foundNum = true and break searchLabel.', 'Outer loop over numbers.length, inner loop over numbers[i].length.', 'searchLabel: for (int i = 0; i < numbers.length; i++) { for (int j = 0; j < numbers[i].length; j++) { if (searchNum == numbers[i][j]) { foundNum = true; break searchLabel; } } }', 100, 8, 20, 1, '2026-10-10 08:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 'Use the exact solution shown in the goal.', 'searchLabel:\\s+for\\s*\\(int\\s+i\\s+=\\s+0;\\s+i\\s+<\\s+numbers\\.length;\\s+i\\+\\+\\)\\s*\\{\\s*for\\s*\\(int\\s+j\\s+=\\s+0;\\s+j\\s+<\\s+numbers\\[i\\]\\.length;\\s+j\\+\\+\\)\\s*\\{\\s*if\\s*\\(searchNum\\s+==\\s+numbers\\[i\\]\\[j\\]\\)\\s*\\{\\s*foundNum\\s+=\\s+true;\\s+break\\s+searchLabel;\\s*\\}\\s*\\}\\s*\\}', '/assets/landscapes/oakheart4.png', 'A Labeled break Search', 'At the vault, two nested loops walk through every row and every column of the grid. When the value is found, the program sets foundNum to true and uses a labeled break to terminate the outer loop at once, instead of only the inner one. The guide labels the outer loop searchLabel.

Assume numbers, searchNum and foundNum already exist. Label the outer for loop searchLabel:, loop with i < numbers.length and j < numbers[i].length, and when searchNum == numbers[i][j], set foundNum = true and break searchLabel.', 10, 1, '{"tile_elevations": {}}', 10, 0.78000000, 1, 8, 'searchLabel: for (int i = 0; i < numbers.length; i++) { for (int j = 0; j < numbers[i].length; j++) { if (searchNum == numbers[i][j]) { foundNum = true; break searchLabel; } } }', '[{"part": "searchLabel:", "explanation": "The label on the outer loop."}, {"part": "for (int i = 0; i < numbers.length; i++)", "explanation": "Goes through every row."}, {"part": "for (int j = 0; j < numbers[i].length; j++)", "explanation": "Goes through every column of the current row."}, {"part": "if (searchNum == numbers[i][j])", "explanation": "True when the current cell holds the number being searched."}, {"part": "foundNum = true; break searchLabel;", "explanation": "Records the result and terminates the labeled outer loop."}]');

